/// M02 CORE-041 "bundled templates: wrong exact target rejected".
/// Source: tests/integration/templates_test.go symbol
/// TestCurrentBundledTemplates.
/// Related fixtures: compiler/testdata/current/templates/main.can (the
/// double_helper when row L62 "sample: use doubled(2)" is restaged as
/// "sample: use tripled(2)"; doubled L27-32 and tripled in helpers.can
/// L4-9 share signatures, so only the exact target differs).
/// Disposition: RETAIN (migrate row; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row, variant, environment and
/// control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): a use naming the wrong exact target fails the
/// staged build even though the signatures match; canlc assert exits
/// nonzero and the diagnostics name "not the invoked"; the invalid staged
/// project is never silently admitted.
/// The 13-root green pin and the quiet assert live in
/// core-041-roots-green.can; the silent production run, fixture erasure
/// and strict emission live in core-041-production-shape.can.
/// Variants: wrong target mutation (doubled -> tripled) against helpers.
/// Environment: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE + macOS sandbox-exec; requires
/// can-bun-archive, macos-sandbox-exec. Logical gates SUITE/DIAG/FAULT and
/// C/R/N/S/A identities bind at P23; no live run now.
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23).
/// Case bundled/templates-wrong-target checks: build-red, diag-names,
/// signatures-match, mutation-applied, wrong-target-rejected,
/// no-silent-admit.
/// Facet map (templates_test.go legs): build-red pins the build leg
/// (L142-145: exit nonzero); diag-names pins the diagnostics predicate
/// (L143: diagnostics contain "not the invoked"); signatures-match pins the
/// matching-signatures facet (L137-138: doubled/tripled signatures match);
/// mutation-applied pins the staged-mutation facet (L139-141: restaged
/// source carries "sample: use tripled(2)"); wrong-target-rejected pins the
/// rejection facet (L143-145: the wrong exact target fails the staged
/// build); no-silent-admit pins the no-admission facet (L143: status 0 is
/// refused).
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later integrator decision.
